This repository is original work. Fisher's exact test and the percentile
bootstrap are standard statistical procedures, implemented here from their
published definitions. No third-party statistical source code is copied.

Claude Code and Codex session shapes are parsed from publicly documented
JSONL layouts. HarnessWatch does not include Anthropic or OpenAI source code,
and those names are used only to identify the CLIs under test.
